  "title": "Spicy Corn on the Cob",
  "description": "Spicy corn on the cob with chili-flavored butter is easy to cook on the grill when you wrap the corn in aluminum foil. Simple and delicious!",
  "authors": [
    "Deann"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-09-01T12:29:43-04:00",
